## Next Board Meeting: November 3, 2026, at 11:00 a.m.

**[Agenda for November 3 meeting (PDF)](https://mcg.montgomerycountymd.gov/Elections/Resources/Files/pdfs/Board%20Information/Board%20Meeting%20Documents/2026/11%20Nov/Agenda%20Board%20Meeting%20November%203%202026.pdf)**

[Join the Board Meeting via Zoom](https://us02web.zoom.us/j/89643294556?pwd=sZgO0RKg2LdNXR8iHqE12qbIwX6zxt.1), in-person, or by phone. To join by phone: **Call 301-715-8592** and provide the **Meeting ID (896 4329 4556)** and **Passcode (351515)**.

The Board asks that all online and in-person observers of its meetings or canvass sessions provide their full names when signing in to attend. Thank you.

### More resources

*   Visit the [Board's Meeting page](https://mcg.montgomerycountymd.gov/Elections/BoardInformation/meeting-documents.html) for additional information, to obtain meeting documents, and/or to view recordings of past meetings.
*   View the schedule and livestreaming links from the 2026 Gubernatorial Canvass and Certification at: [2026 Gubernatorial General Election Canvass sessions](https://mcg.montgomerycountymd.gov/Elections/2026GeneralElection/general-ballot-canvass.html)

### Challengers and Watchers

See the [State Board of Elections’ Challengers and Watchers Guide (PDF)](https://elections.maryland.gov/get_involved/Challengers_and_Watchers_Manual-2026.pdf). Under State law, a Certificate for each Challenger and Watcher must be submitted to the Election Director.

For Election Day, you must submit Certificates no later than 5:00 p.m. on Friday, October 30, 2026. Email Certificates to **[elections@montgomerycountymd.gov](mailto:elections@montgomerycountymd.gov)**, with subject line: Challengers and Watchers Certificate.

### Polling Place Changes

State law provides that interested individuals and organizations may sign up to be notified about Board of Elections meetings at which proposed polling place changes will be discussed and may testify upon request. [**Sign up to receive Polling Place Discussion notices**](https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/baa64744a7da4ab3bcad1b76dca2722c).

